{"sha":"59e3a3338d516ca6ce0e073af8da65289678a35c","node_id":"C_kwDOBrVDM9oAKDU5ZTNhMzMzOGQ1MTZjYTZjZTBlMDczYWY4ZGE2NTI4OTY3OGEzNWM","commit":{"author":{"name":"David Kogan","email":"38084383+davidkny22@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-09-03T01:26:22Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-03T01:26:22Z"},"message":"Require CUDA 12.9 for SM121 default architectures (#3410)\n\nCUDA 12.8 does not advertise SM121 compiler targets, but CUTLASS currently adds 121 and 121a to its supported and default architecture list at that version. CUDA 12.9 advertises SM121. Move those two tokens into the existing CUDA 12.9 block beside 121f so each fresh default list matches its active compiler.\n\nSigned-off-by: David Kogan <davidkny22@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"8075bc518398025f752985176f2835f71fe3275b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/git/trees/8075bc518398025f752985176f2835f71fe3275b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/git/commits/59e3a3338d516ca6ce0e073af8da65289678a35c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmMy+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/v0QAIYc4jKCFqwPD4vvP4ahW8zf\nz+ZlQ99pEvU5nMxZ8kRKGtfNo/yobfzwLWTt4jJ1sXzLX3O2g7A07/S2UcGxaQ9S\nFLOHBVsIbqTwEn7hK+ZWybFiDPkGbCKyDlDbZJcZzlEtsaKq0aVzYzDMV5UTKLoL\nIUSV+yHtO7plpyEly7RnkLeU/Qok37az5LTlqZrjAAjrBWdI4bE0BBnsdvYsQDKf\n5uOqFKfeqAZeBZf9fWaj/uReVjlTlih7xLC5qlK1hTLWxv3cQdNnnX6r3MytMz1s\n+80oxNdoeGsutuadHs7cXSTbwLrzOgBHaEJvWaMW9nIwjfbb9zzbOhOTZpckD+TM\nUkowbCY4tnR/kK0teIWyacuW7/eHHh046UVAM5B55q13zrV0EaNGrbYagJL/U1sq\npN8bX8UzLluJ0v8VNLAWQ5+DWFTwm+2was/nLpQDpw5nrDcdxdeFB/4nrXcSwqvI\nITq4AnOFbAVuwR3Kst3IZuUz4EMtlf1Oh7K24Z74iATOalR3CLnOn2X20NkF2E/a\nUmwTayL4Hiy1UJYMyV5d1BEcv0f1eAkN2XXN53qDCN0w93C3qT20AXKbzUj0MmJu\nuDUMPTg5lAqgp0h/ht+cnv9QCpVGUJ8/ySRljayeM7TqzyBO2TX6IGecuhGTKQ3m\nKh/ntBa/7vFVdvNP2EIw\n=Ridc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 8075bc518398025f752985176f2835f71fe3275b\nparent 1b5b7d30623ad7021cfce8066fa08801b305b137\nauthor David Kogan <38084383+davidkny22@users.noreply.github.com> 1788398782 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788398782 +0800\n\nRequire CUDA 12.9 for SM121 default architectures (#3410)\n\nCUDA 12.8 does not advertise SM121 compiler targets, but CUTLASS currently adds 121 and 121a to its supported and default architecture list at that version. CUDA 12.9 advertises SM121. Move those two tokens into the existing CUDA 12.9 block beside 121f so each fresh default list matches its active compiler.\n\nSigned-off-by: David Kogan <davidkny22@gmail.com>","verified_at":"2026-09-03T01:26:22Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/commits/59e3a3338d516ca6ce0e073af8da65289678a35c","html_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass/commit/59e3a3338d516ca6ce0e073af8da65289678a35c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/commits/59e3a3338d516ca6ce0e073af8da65289678a35c/comments","author":{"login":"davidkny22","id":38084383,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDg0Mzgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38084383?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidkny22","html_url":"https://github.com/davidkny22","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidkny22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidkny22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidkny22/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidkny22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidkny22/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidkny22/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidkny22/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidkny22/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidkny22/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"M